# Orphaned "_1"-suffixed resource snapshot files regenerated by `uip solution
# pack` (a known CLI packaging defect) for any process/API resource shared by
# name across 2+ BPMN files. These are worked around at deploy time by
# scripts/deploy_solution.py but the underlying `pack` command still
# recreates them in-place in the tracked resources/solution_folder tree on
# every invocation. Safe to ignore/regenerate; never hand-author or commit
# these. See "Known issue: upgrade deploy fails with #4010" in
# .github/copilot-instructions.md for full details.
resources/solution_folder/process/process/*_1.json
resources/solution_folder/process/api/*_1.json
resources/solution_folder/package/motor-claims-tls.*.json
node_modules/
